{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Leystone Springs restores mana on auto attacks, more with Runic Tattoos: Water (#1660)",
  "contract": [
    "Leystone Springs 300581 (Runic tree talent, CharacterAdvancement 34578): 'Your melee auto attacks now have a",
    "$h% chance to restore ${$520866m1*$<scalingbp>} mana. While Runic Tattoos: Water is active, the mana",
    "restored is increased by $s2%.' Effect 0 is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 520866 (ProcChance 15), effect 1 carries",
    "$s2 = 250. Spell.dbc gives 300581 ProcFlags 0 and no spell_proc row existed, so the aura never procced.",
    "520866 is an energize (mana) with m1 = 75 (BasePoints 74, DieSides 1) and SpellDescriptionVariables 182",
    "scalingbp = 0.0267291844060354 + 0.0048541098014737*PL + 0.0001859597762293*PL^2 = 1.6052 at level 80, so a",
    "proc restores 120 mana, and 420 (x3.5) while the Runemaster's own Water tattoo 801107 is active.",
    "Expected: landed main- and off-hand auto attacks proc 520866 at about 15% (68 swings in 60 sec, so no proc has",
    "probability 0.85^68 < 2e-5; the upper bound of 0.75 procs per main-hand swing excludes a proc on every swing),",
    "each proc restores 120 mana without the tattoo and 421 with it; the tattoo alone or the talent alone leaves",
    "the amount at 120. Weapon skills and Dual Wield are fixture setup."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
  "location": {"map": 0, "x": -8949.95, "y": -132.493, "z": 83.5312, "o": 0},
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "melee_hit_rating": 10000, "expertise_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "golem", "owner": "rm", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 1000000, "distance": 3}
  ],
